cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below. Demo outputs are SYNTHETIC; real-data results on NAB and SMD are REPORTED in the README (StreamGuard does not beat the standard baselines there)."
title: "Spark StreamGuard: a fail-closed, auditable gate for any streaming detector"
type: software
authors:
